{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p000463","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p000463"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p000463","label":"龍賈","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"龍賈","mention_ids":["c-shiji-005-qin:m065-0041"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m065-0041","chapter_id":"c-shiji-005-qin","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-005-qin:p065","quote":"龍賈"}],"identity_note":"依本卷特定時代與事件暫定人物；不以同稱、官號或短名全域合併，未見本名不補造。","review":"ai_provisional"}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m065-0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"龍賈","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000463","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-005-qin:p065","chapter_id":"c-shiji-005-qin"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:p065","text":"五年，陰晉人犀首為大良造。六年，魏納陰晉，陰晉更名寧秦。七年，公子卬與魏戰，虜其將龍賈，斬首八萬。八年，魏納河西地。九年，渡河，取汾陰、皮氏。與魏王會應。圍焦，降之。十年，張儀相秦。魏納上郡十五縣。十一年，縣義渠。歸魏焦、曲沃。義渠君為臣。更名少梁曰夏陽。十二年，初臘。十三年四月戊午，魏君為王，韓亦為王。使張儀伐取陜，出其人與魏。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m065-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"犀首","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000461","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m065-0031","start":31,"end":34,"surface":"公子卬","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000462","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m065-0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"龍賈","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000463","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m065-0072","start":72,"end":74,"surface":"魏王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"官稱、氏族、群體或未核指代；不補造個人或按熟知世系自動合併。"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m065-0086","start":86,"end":88,"surface":"張儀","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000464","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-